      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "L/Roarsは実力が全て。上がるも\r\n落ちるもてめぇ次第…。\r\nシビれるだろ？最高のチームさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0525d4c2c804ea0dabc0abcd80040f071bcb3197a54f566910850db20a3698c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
