        "1094",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f581506d940d331db7df352",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ダンスの練習、付き合えよ。\r\nダセェとこ見せらんねーからな。\r\nビシっと決めてこそウマ娘だろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2239549e3119b3a871e44a118a6c710b099befb29ea626fc643cd23176ee89c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca47dd8f0c8572b261432190",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "バカ強ぇヤツらと走らせろよ。\r\n勝負服が俺に言うんだ…\r\nブッちぎらせろ、ってなぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "404040e44b353701cb0da7b9713daced85a3ae903274a09d0d076f17fd0eb853",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd43af2922f099a979121c4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ブーツはフリー時代と同じモンだ。\r\nみんなと踏んだ土がにじんでる…\r\n一生履き潰してやるつもりだぜ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53fe2a342d3958a45f9aeeadbc045e5c71a856e6766d19b5b1bf3e2202a7832d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a570a18a876ce64f4782a4d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "フジさんに朝の挨拶したの、\r\n俺が1番ノリなんだぜ～！\r\nやー、楽しい1日になるなこりゃ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d27cdb20c758893a3a38ff97beab1f98489028c2a5ae29e02773e4acc6be33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38a086de3b288dab9c9dc3aa",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ま～たセンコーの呼び出しかよぉ。\r\n街でもめたアレ…いや、マナー悪い\r\n先輩詰めた時の…うーん、どれだ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07a646247edc68f6028c5aa1e127705e82443f3a31e5a64e47bddbb56b34ec7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6dd6d99f97dfb48b531442e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相手してやる。\r\nちゃんと楽しませろよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b881c3f12bd8ce7ac5074040e9c1b7ec5bfefdbdd097ca51b716ba5b58cbd53a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "910100"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/910100"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940792a4f221b5d0e34be24b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今夜、寮のテレビは俺のもんだ。\r\n誰が最強か、見届けてやる――\r\n楽しみ過ぎるぜ、『爆笑王』…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d3e6ab2de716939d3a40be96964335b099929e7fe81e8677e258e18da3aa76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9220913493fa90a40455aba",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新顔のヤツら気合い入ってんなー。\r\nいやぁ、よかったぜ。\r\n退屈しなくて済みそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a615783761e18139c13b2ca47a9056d2ad31476f89cd830af816d8f82934e4bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1fe7b6d461c2bbd97623138",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "あっちー…けど、フリーん時は\r\n関係なく走ってたなぁ…ハハッ。\r\n昔の自分にゃ負けらんねぇぜ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ea722036c7af8f12299bb63bcc43ca36ac551c3b7aa1c7cc969a4afbd898021",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b3cbd1dfe571eaaa95ad3a6",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ジャージに刺繍入れたくてよー。\r\nほら、芸術の秋って言うだろ？\r\nな、龍と虎、どっちが渋い？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eefdf17037e690fec6b2fc713fe7f11de0598a892a0477d12979e421dd545dac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba905cd630118b08bb24e81",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "んぐ…またやっちまったー！\r\n俺を止めてくれ…塗ったそばから\r\nリップクリームなめちまうんだよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b524e0158103d2a17a4e1f0c5991bb919c5f7e412d95db71b0e0e880b0ce66d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1094",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1094/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83752cee2b240c6646799f03",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最強の俺がトレーニングすんだ。\r\nハッ、強くなりすぎちまうな！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dcbcc6abc3da5f3922f896ebe3f9c197fbbb879f90ad865b7bdd99811508ae6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
