      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“最強”の俺！\r\n“最強の相棒”のお前！\r\nへへッ、俺たち無敵だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebf462ce00f96b0e42938d4f9486c37fa073f78d12e7271e8a0f854c300f6405",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
