      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265e8cbc15b6439a75bdb64c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本是熟练的点心制作，\n不知为何手心发热…是因为\n是为您做的巧克力吗…",
      "source_fingerprint": "bada3ae61bbced39477f78a6e3703457292ef712d0cf2439ba1e061252494a3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867ba4d479ef154a9cffb23f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次的巧克力，或许做得太甜了\n…想着要做出能让您\n永远记住的味道…就不自觉地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c8cb20a28a71d170dfaf361b9372e5a8cc97c9b94462c5e2d21eeef1cc61b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788963fdde6effc72c9320a1",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稍微，有点羡慕织女呢。如果与\n心爱之人相见的时间短暂…不就\n能只展现美好的一面了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b414ad53ba10910ac91de77608d73ab6cd41aa94b84fddaa79e229f4e3a579",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3c8932fc5a9f5ca37a07ac7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "偶尔被捉弄也很有趣\n但是…能给大家分发美味的点心\n是比什么都美好的事情",
      "source_fingerprint": "96dbd3a13ec171ee990f4d48981bbee6ec3c46b248dcc38f280d0954f11308df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641f9bc45769ebdf258ce635",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "分发礼物的任务…\n我或许很适合。因为即使进入房间\n也不太容易被注意到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dddb001ac59b704c1d738f662856baaec38b9da061dcc35e19c3a152cd1d6580",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5cf62b1e38401b259a696b4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在老家，做圣诞蛋糕\n是我的任务。能为家人做些什么\n…是件幸福的事呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c7902ed13a392613c0467b02ee023bd06d966e52fdff2f9343b1a1e7c2e1402",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dafb8a7a6220062bbe65b390",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多谢款待…",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad57742c935f2877760495b796f514639c58fb7c600f6f1905b7ad24c952b10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:656b31bb854a8982660300b4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员室的话，已经\n打扫完毕了哦。\n…呵呵，您注意到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f47aae73b47560b16ed8da11620917cbc374d0b1e46312271dd72202620f2d13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c6d08f1021ea0deb7c5ca13",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想推荐的蛋糕店\n太多了…那个…如果您愿意的话，\n能一起去挑选就好了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e3fa65e818c441389535f491bc7c5d5eb174512332c199178ce482c658141a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0684b3bb72d40c50d0d8c3b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小时候的您是什么样的人呢\n遇见了谁，知晓了什么…\n如果可以的话请讲给我听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91b0b1bd4a852f9f33ed713b0b37c6ef43bc26cb5e1c276351f6ccf280b5505",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63cb3f12e1bb3e45c459b3f7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了不擅长阳光的我，父母在\n生日时送给了我面纱…虽然几次\n更换了新的，但回忆是永恒的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6266fa561eb40bca332433b341b979f0b12668e53b894e62a3337ba1ade716df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6eb3e77c2da1a9ef7b9d74",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生日时，总会思考自己与生俱来的\n本性…但是，已经\n不痛苦了。因为有您在",
      "source_fingerprint": "f601a919a2056ccd98cc5618733913cf8cc46f7edea8705ea2f81b29198ccc98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1097",
        "10014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1097/10014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a09644f7111c6fe93db81b2",
      "kind": "character_system",
